{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋で\nセブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベント\nでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリはこの前 載せましたので\n省略させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋でセブンイレブンと言えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コク旨 仕立てのピリ辛台湾丼\nが食べたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ発売してなかったんだけど\n昨日の夜セブンイレブン行ったら\nチラシが貼ってあった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしそー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地域限定ものずるい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ\n我らが埼玉にもありますけどね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ライブレポに戻りますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東と違って\nモニターが無かったのですが\nみなさん見えましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しは\n中田を見つけられましたかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくたくさんの方が来てくださって\n嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がってくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全握です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意なスポーツは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きな食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてとか\n伊織推しとか\nいっぱいループしてとかで\n中田と何を話したらいいかわからないかたは\nどっちか教えてください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□全国握手券(応募券部分を切り取ってないやつ)\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント等)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう家出てるかな？\nブログ書くの遅くなってごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/18/5029831/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金の例のウニ色の服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}